  "title": "REPAY Announces Agreement to Acquire KUBRA",
  "summary": "Combination creates a Scaled Consumer Bill Payment Provider REPAY to host conference call tomorrow at 8:00 AM ET ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Mar. 30, 2026-- Repay Holdings Corporation (NASDAQ: RPAY) (“REPAY” or the “Company”), a leading provider of integrated payment processing solutions, today announced a definitive agreement to acquire Kubra Data Transfer LTD. (“KUBRA”) for approximately $372 million. The acquisition will be financed with a combination […]",
